   509→            <p>
   510→                Comprehensive list of all rendering capabilities organized by category. Click to expand and see detailed feature descriptions with links to documentation.
   511→            </p>
   512→
   513→            <details style="margin-top: 2rem; border: 2px solid #2E7D32; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;">
   514→                <summary style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2E7D32 0%, #1B5E20 100%); color: white; padding: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; user-select: none;">
   515→                    View All Engine Capabilities (26 Features)
   516→                </summary>
   517→
   518→                <div style="padding: 2rem; background: white;">
   519→                    <!-- Category 1: Core Rendering -->
   520→                    <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
   521→                        <h3 style="color: #2E7D32; font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; border-bottom: 2px solid #2E7D32;">1. Core Rendering</h3>
   522→                        <p style="color: #666; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Fundamental drawing operations: shape rasterization, edge-list algorithm, Porter-Duff compositing.</p>
   523→                        <ul style="line-height: 2; color: #555;">
   524→                            <li><strong>Edge Rasterization</strong> – Scanline algorithm using sorted edge list for efficient pixel coverage</li>
